claims=[
('technique-relevance',[P],[R['paper'],R['incident'],'REF-000625'],'strongly-inferred','high','认证证书对应私钥控制、正常签发结果取得及服务外构造均属于凭据获取，但材料取得与后继身份使用需要分别证明。','Private-key control for authentication certificates, acquisition through normal issuance, and off-service construction belong to Credential Access, while acquisition and successor identity use require separate evidence.'),
('technique-boundary',[P],[R['export'],R['paper']],'strongly-inferred','high','公开证书读取不等于私钥控制；导出命令或容器存在也不能代替可用私钥与输出控制证据。','Reading a public certificate does not establish private-key control, and an export invocation or container cannot replace evidence of a usable private key and output control.'),
('subtechnique-existence',[P,S1],[R['processing'],R['incident'],R['administration']],'strongly-inferred','medium','受信签发上下文挟持以真实控制者与请求身份、代表权限及批准意图脱节为稳定变量，保留正常签发外观而把区分信息移到来源和授权关联。','Trusted Enrollment-Context Hijacking separates the real controller from request identity, delegated authority, and approval intent, preserving normal issuance appearance while shifting discriminating evidence to provenance and authorization correlation.'),
('subtechnique-existence',[P,S2],[R['forge'],R['processing']],'strongly-inferred','medium','服务外受信签名构造省略权威请求与数据库事务，使证书接受与正常签发记录之间的连续性成为独立观察变量。','Off-service construction with trusted signing omits authority request and database transactions, making continuity between certificate acceptance and normal issuance records an independent observation variable.'),
('mechanism-mapping',[P,S1,S2],[R['incident'],R['forge'],R['mapping']],'strongly-inferred','medium','有效签名和被接受签发身份可借用合法认证凭据特征，但合法密码学验证本身不证明实际操作者或组织批准。','Valid signatures and accepted enrollment identities can borrow legitimate credential features, but correct cryptographic validation alone establishes neither the real operator nor organizational approval.'),
('detection',[P,S2],[R['processing'],'REF-000854',R['certutil']],'strongly-inferred','medium','认证证书与历史签发库存的差分只有在库存完整性、迁移、外部签发者和同步延迟被解释后才形成可靠调查线索，缺失本身不证明伪造。','Differences between an authentication certificate and historical issuance inventory become reliable investigative leads only after explaining completeness, migrations, external issuers, and synchronization delays; absence alone does not prove forgery.'),
('detection',[P],[R['migration']],'directly-observed','high','Windows 5059 的 export 类操作可在普通密钥读取时出现，事件成功不能单独证明可携私钥已产生或被攻击者取得。','An export-class Windows 5059 operation can accompany an ordinary key read, so event success alone does not prove creation or adversary acquisition of portable private-key material.'),
('detection',[P],[R['keyfile'],R['migration'],R['crypto']],'strongly-inferred','high','5058、5059 和 5061 的官方保证受指定 KSP 和审计路径限制，系统事件执行进程不能无验证地等同实际恶意业务调用者。','Official guarantees for 5058, 5059, and 5061 are limited to specified KSPs and audit paths, and the system event execution process cannot be treated as the malicious business caller without validation.'),
('mitigation',[P,S2],['REF-000499',R['ca'],R['administration']],'strongly-inferred','medium','硬件隔离可提高私钥复制成本，但签名调用授权和签发者失守恢复仍是独立控制责任。','Hardware isolation can increase the cost of key copying, while signature-invocation authority and recovery from issuer compromise remain independent control responsibilities.'),
('mitigation',[P,S1,S2],[R['incident'],R['administration']],'strongly-inferred','high','口令重置不能替代认证证书与签发者信任处置，也不自动撤销已经建立的票据和资源会话。','Password resets cannot replace handling authentication certificates and issuer trust and do not automatically revoke established tickets or resource sessions.')]
