strategy_data=[
(D1,[P,S1],[A1],'签发身份主体与批准意图关联','Enrollment Identity Subject and Approval-Intent Correlation','识别正常签发事务中请求者、目标身份与批准用途的脱节。','Identify differences among requesters, represented identities, and approved purpose within normal issuance.',N(('该策略连接真实请求、签发数据库、解析证书与历史授权范围，关注 CA 技术上接受请求却不符合组织批准意图的情形。后继证书认证只增强可用性判断，不代替对请求控制者与授权的核查。','This strategy joins actual requests, issuance databases, parsed certificates, and historical authority to identify enrollment accepted technically by a CA but inconsistent with organizational approval. Successor certificate authentication strengthens usability assessment without replacing investigation of request control and authorization.')),[R['processing'],R['incident'],R['administration'],R['certutil'],R['mapping'],'REF-000708','REF-000854']),
(D2,[P,S2],[A2],'认证接受与完整签发谱系差分','Authentication Acceptance and Complete Issuance-Lineage Differential','将证书认证与长期可信签发库存比较，保留不明谱系与采集缺口的区别。','Compare certificate authentication with durable trusted issuance inventory while separating unexplained lineage from collection gaps.',N(('该策略把依赖方已经观察到的证书回连完整签发历史。它针对服务外构造可能造成的记录断裂，但不把找不到日志直接当成伪造；库存完整性、外部签发者和迁移历史是结论成立的条件。','This strategy links a certificate observed by a relying party to complete issuance history. It addresses discontinuity potentially caused by off-service construction without treating a missing log as forgery; inventory completeness, external issuers, and migration history are conditions of the conclusion.')),[R['forge'],R['processing'],'REF-000854',R['certutil']]),
(D3,[P],[A3],'认证私钥操作与材料结果分级','Authentication Private-Key Operations and Material-Outcome Grading','区分密钥访问线索、可携材料形成、攻击者控制与后继认证。','Separate key-access leads, portable-material creation, adversary control, and successor authentication.',N(('该策略直接覆盖既有终端认证私钥的取得，并把 CA 私钥暴露保留为构造能力线索。KSP 成功事件只证明相应操作，材料内容与实际控制必须由输出验证或受控调查补齐，不能由进程名或 PFX 后缀替代。','This strategy directly covers acquisition of existing end-entity authentication keys and retains CA-key exposure as a construction-capability lead. A successful KSP event establishes its operation only; output validation or controlled investigation must establish material content and actual control rather than a process name or PFX suffix.')),[R['migration'],R['keyfile'],R['crypto'],R['export'],R['paper']])]
